---
title: "Tooltip"
description: "Short hint shown on hover or keyboard focus, built on the Popover API."
tags: [overlay, accessibility, javascript]
usage: |
  Give the trigger `data-tooltip` with the id of the tooltip, and the tooltip the
  `tooltip` class, `role="tooltip"` and `popover="manual"`. Link them for anchor
  positioning with `anchor-name` on the trigger and `position-anchor` on the
  tooltip. Then call `initTooltips()`:

  ```js
  import { initTooltips } from "./tooltip.js";

  initTooltips(); // or initTooltips(root, "[data-tooltip]")
  ```

  It sits above its trigger and flips below when there is no room. Set
  `data-placement` to `bottom`, `left` or `right` to change the side. Browsers
  without anchor positioning get a script fallback.
accessibility: |
  - Point the trigger's `aria-describedby` at the tooltip so its text is read
    as a description.
  - It shows on focus as well as hover, and Escape hides it.
  - Tooltip content must be supplementary. Never put essential information or
    interactive content in it.
customProperties:
  "--tooltip-offset": "Distance from the trigger."
  "--tooltip-padding": "Inner spacing."
  "--tooltip-radius": "Corner radius."
  "--tooltip-font-size": "Font size."
  "--tooltip-max-inline-size": "Maximum width."
  "--tooltip-background": "Background color."
  "--tooltip-color": "Text color."
---

<link rel="stylesheet" href="./styles.css" media="screen">

<p class="tooltip-demo">
  <button type="button" style="anchor-name: --tip-save" aria-describedby="tip-save" data-tooltip="tip-save">Save</button>
  <button type="button" style="anchor-name: --tip-bottom" aria-describedby="tip-bottom" data-tooltip="tip-bottom">Bottom</button>
  <button type="button" style="anchor-name: --tip-left" aria-describedby="tip-left" data-tooltip="tip-left">Left</button>
  <button type="button" style="anchor-name: --tip-right" aria-describedby="tip-right" data-tooltip="tip-right">Right</button>
</p>
<div id="tip-save" class="tooltip" role="tooltip" popover="manual" style="position-anchor: --tip-save">Saves your changes</div>
<div id="tip-bottom" class="tooltip" role="tooltip" popover="manual" data-placement="bottom" style="position-anchor: --tip-bottom">Shown below</div>
<div id="tip-left" class="tooltip" role="tooltip" popover="manual" data-placement="left" style="position-anchor: --tip-left">Shown on the left</div>
<div id="tip-right" class="tooltip" role="tooltip" popover="manual" data-placement="right" style="position-anchor: --tip-right">Shown on the right</div>

<script type="module">
  import { initTooltips } from "./tooltip.js";

  initTooltips();
</script>
